{
  "uid": "monetka-model-serving",
  "title": "Монетка — обслуживание модели",
  "description": "Operational health of the inference service. Everything here is available without labels, which is what makes it useful the moment a release goes out.",
  "tags": ["monetka", "ml", "serving"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "editable": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Запросов за подсказкой",
      "description": "Total advisor calls. A drop to zero means the app stopped asking, not that the model is fine.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(monetka_inference_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "всего",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#E5C78F" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Доля ответов модели",
      "description": "Share of hints the model chose rather than the rules. Low is not an error: the model may only act where the rules are indifferent. Zero means personalisation is effectively off.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(monetka_inference_total{source=\"model\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(monetka_inference_total[$__range])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "модель",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#D7AAA0", "value": null },
              { "color": "#E5C78F", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Отказов модели (вне горизонта)",
      "description": "Abstentions because the period is past the model's validated horizon. Expected and healthy — the model declining to guess is the designed behaviour, not a failure.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(monetka_inference_total{source=\"abstain_out_of_range\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "отказы",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#C4AA8E" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Задержка инференса, p95",
      "description": "On-device budget is 50 ms. ТЗ §3.4 allows a second for a visible response; a model near that has already ruined the interaction.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(monetka_inference_latency_seconds_bucket[5m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#E5C78F", "value": null },
              { "color": "#D7AAA0", "value": 50 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Источник подсказки во времени",
      "description": "Rule and model arms side by side. A sudden collapse of the model line is a deployment problem; a gradual change usually means the population moved.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (source) (rate(monetka_inference_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "model" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#E5C78F" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "rule" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#C4AA8E" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Задержка инференса по перцентилям",
      "description": "p50 next to p95: a p50 that is fine while p95 climbs is a tail problem, usually cold starts rather than the model itself.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, model) (rate(monetka_inference_latency_seconds_bucket[5m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{model}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, model) (rate(monetka_inference_latency_seconds_bucket[5m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{model}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "#D7AAA0", "value": 50 }
            ]
          },
          "custom.thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Как читать этот дашборд",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Этот дашборд отвечает на один вопрос: исправна ли выкладка.** Он не отвечает на вопрос, приносит ли модель пользу — для этого нужна витрина `gold.mart_model_performance` и команда `monetka monitor`, которая сравнивает случайно назначенные группы.\n\n| Что видно | Что это значит |\n|---|---|\n| Доля ответов модели упала до нуля | Модель не загрузилась или просела по задержке — приложение перешло на правила. Игровой цикл цел, персонализации нет. |\n| Отказы вне горизонта растут | Нормально: когорта взрослеет, архетипы сходятся, модель честно не отвечает. |\n| p95 выше 50 мс | Бюджет инференса на устройстве превышен. Смотреть размер модели и холодный старт. |\n| Все подсказки одинаковые | Схлопывание: почти всегда сломанный конвейер признаков. |\n\nСервер **не на критическом пути** игры: обязательный сценарий работает офлайн, на устройстве (ТЗ §3.1.5)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
